      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Errante. O estômago de Yungoos ocupa a maior parte de seu tronco. Ele percorre diariamente o mesmo caminho em busca de comida fresca e passa todas as horas acordado procurando alimento. Quando sente fome, fica ainda mais feroz.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Yungoos pode evoluir para Gumshoos no nível 7 ou superior, durante o dia. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Leer, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Payback, Pursuit</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Sand Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Odor Sleuth, Work Up</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Bide</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Bite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Mud-Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Super Fang</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Scary Face</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Crunch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Hyper Fang</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Yawn</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Rest, Thrash</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Bulldoze, Chilling Water, Confide, Crunch, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Earthquake, Echoed Voice, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Fire Fang, Frustration, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Ice Fang, Iron Tail, Last Resort, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Payback, Protect, Psychic Fangs, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Reversal, Rock Tomb, Round, Sandstorm, Scary Face, Seed Bomb, Shock Wave, Sleep Talk, Snore, Stomping Tantrum, Substitute, Sunny Day, Super Fang, Swagger, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder Fang, Torment, Toxic, Trailblaze, U-turn, Uproar, Wild Charge, Work Up, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Endeavor, Fire Fang, Ice Fang, Last Resort, Revenge, Thunder Fang</p>",
